'''Volsung''' is one of the eight high-ranked [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest|dragon priests]] in Skyrim. Volsung drops an [[Skyrim:Volsung (item)|eponymous mask]], which makes [[Skyrim:Fortify Barter|prices better]] by 20%, [[Skyrim:Fortify Carry Weight|increases carrying weight]] by 20 points, and gives [[Skyrim:Waterbreathing (effect)|waterbreathing]].

Volsung can be found in [[Skyrim:Volskygge|Volskygge]] in northwestern Skyrim. Note that you can just climb the mountain above the entrance and skip the dungeon entirely.

